	key[]: "o_im_slide_axle_manual_op_tooltip"
	val[]: "Assigns button to toggle manual axle/tandem adjustment mode, if your trailer has sliding axle/tandem. Manual adjustment mode brakes the trailer wheels and uncouples the axle/tandem from the chassis, so the axle/tandem position can be adjusted by moving the truck.<br><br>When unassigned, axles are moved automatically to fit the current situation."

